@startuml fluxo-eventos-normal
!theme plain
autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"
skinparam DefaultFontName "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
skinparam DefaultFontSize 12
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam BoxPadding 10

skinparam sequence {
    GroupBorderColor #7F8C8D
    GroupBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    GroupHeaderFontColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #BDC3C7
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

box "Camada de Cliente" #EBF5FB
    actor "Usuário / Web SPA\n(React + TypeScript)" as Client #3498DB
end box

box "Borda & Roteamento" #EAECEE
    participant "API Gateway\n(Node.js / Express)" as Gateway #34495E
end box

box "CQRS Write Model (Command Side)" #E8F8F5
    participant "Command API\n(Image Processing)" as CmdService #1ABC9C
    database "PostgreSQL (Write Store)\n[Tabelas ACID + Outbox]" as WriteDB #16A085
end box

box "Armazenamento Desacoplado" #FEF9E7
    database "Storage / CDN\n(MinIO / S3 / Nginx)" as Storage #F39C12
end box

box "Barramento de Mensageria (Event Bus)" #FDEDEC
    queue "RabbitMQ Exchange\n[pixpro.events] (topic)" as Exchange #E74C3C
    queue "Fila de Inferência\n[image-queue] (durable)" as Queue #C0392B
    queue "Fila de Projeção CQRS\n[read-model-sync-queue]" as SyncQueue #D35400
end box

box "Processamento IA & Notificações" #F4ECF7
    participant "AI Worker Pool\n(Node.js / Sharp / IA)" as Worker #8E44AD
    participant "Notification Service\n(WebSocket Server)" as Notif #9B59B6
end box

box "CQRS Read Model (Query Side)" #EBF5FB
    participant "Read Model Projector\n(Event Consumer)" as Projector #2980B9
    database "PostgreSQL (Read Store)\n& Redis Cache (Views)" as ReadDB #2471A3
    participant "Query API\n(Histórico / Galeria)" as QueryService #1F618D
end box

== 1. Command Path (Write Model): Recepção do Comando e Persistência Transacional ==

Client -> Gateway: Command: POST /api/images/upload (multipart/form-data)\n[Headers: Authorization (JWT), X-Correlation-ID]
activate Gateway #34495E

Gateway -> Gateway: Valida Token JWT e Rate-Limiting\nRoteia mutação para o Command Side
Gateway -> CmdService: Encaminha UploadImageCommand
activate CmdService #1ABC9C

CmdService -> CmdService: Valida Mime Type (JPEG/PNG/WEBP)\ne limite de tamanho (10MB)

CmdService -> Storage: Salva binário bruto original\n(/storage/raw/usr_123/img_987.jpg)
activate Storage #F39C12
Storage --> CmdService: Confirmação de persistência física (URI)
deactivate Storage

CmdService -> WriteDB: Transação ACID Local:\n1. INSERT INTO images [Status: PENDING]\n2. INSERT INTO outbox_messages [Event: ImageUploaded]
activate WriteDB #16A085
WriteDB --> CmdService: Commit confirmado (imageId: img_987)
deactivate WriteDB

== 2. Publicação de Evento de Domínio & Sincronização Inicial do Read Model ==

CmdService -> Exchange: Publica evento de domínio [ImageUploaded]\nRouting Key: image.uploaded\nPayload: { imageId, userId, filePath, status: "PENDING" }
activate Exchange #E74C3C

Exchange -> Queue: Roteia tarefa para 'image-queue' (Workers IA)
activate Queue #C0392B
Exchange -> SyncQueue: Roteia cópia para 'read-model-sync-queue' (CQRS)
activate SyncQueue #D35400
deactivate Exchange

CmdService -->> Gateway: HTTP 202 Accepted\n{ success: true, imageId: "img_987", status: "PENDING" }
deactivate CmdService

Gateway -->> Client: HTTP 202 Accepted\n(Interface exibe status "Aguardando na Fila")
deactivate Gateway

SyncQueue -> Projector: Consome evento [ImageUploaded]
deactivate SyncQueue
activate Projector #2980B9
Projector -> ReadDB: Upsert assíncrono na projeção desnormalizada\n[image_history_view: status = PENDING] + Invalida Cache Redis
activate ReadDB #2471A3
ReadDB --> Projector: Projeção de leitura atualizada
deactivate ReadDB
deactivate Projector

== 3. Consumo Assíncrono pelo Worker, Inferência de IA e Atualização do Read Model ==

Worker -> Queue: Consome mensagem pendente (basic.consume)
activate Worker #8E44AD
Queue --> Worker: Entrega payload do evento [ImageUploaded]
deactivate Queue

Worker -> Storage: Baixa imagem original para processamento\nGET /storage/raw/usr_123/img_987.jpg
activate Storage #F39C12
Storage --> Worker: Retorna stream binário da imagem
deactivate Storage

Worker -> Worker: Executa Pipeline de IA e Processamento\n• Otimização / Transformação (Sharp / MobileNet)\n• Extração de metadados e métricas

Worker -> Storage: Publica ativo final no Storage / CDN\n(/storage/processed/usr_123/img_987_out.jpg)
activate Storage #F39C12
Storage --> Worker: Retorna URL pública / assinada da CDN
deactivate Storage

Worker -> WriteDB: Atualiza estado no Write Store\n[Status: PROCESSED, CdnUrl, AI_Metrics]
activate WriteDB #16A085
WriteDB --> Worker: Registro transacional atualizado
deactivate WriteDB

Worker -> Exchange: Publica evento de domínio [ImageProcessed]\nRouting Key: image.processed\nPayload: { imageId, userId, cdnUrl, aiMetadata, status: "PROCESSED" }
activate Exchange #E74C3C

Exchange -> SyncQueue: Roteia evento para fila de projeção CQRS
activate SyncQueue #D35400
Exchange -> Notif: Roteia evento para serviço de notificações
deactivate Exchange
activate Notif #9B59B6

Worker -> Queue: Envia ACK de confirmação (basic.ack)
deactivate Worker

SyncQueue -> Projector: Consome evento [ImageProcessed]
deactivate SyncQueue
activate Projector #2980B9
Projector -> ReadDB: Atualiza Read Model de forma assíncrona\n• UPSERT image_history_view (status: PROCESSED, cdnUrl, tags)\n• Atualiza Cache Redis (cache:user:usr_123:history)
activate ReadDB #2471A3
ReadDB --> Projector: Read Model sincronizado (Consistência Eventual)
deactivate ReadDB
deactivate Projector

== 4. Notificação em Tempo Real (WebSocket) & Consulta Otimizada (Query Path) ==

Notif -> Notif: Localiza sessão WebSocket ativa (userId: usr_123)
Notif -->> Client: Push WebSocket (WSS):\n{ type: "IMAGE_READY", imageId: "img_987", cdnUrl: "..." }
deactivate Notif

Client -> Gateway: Query: GET /api/images/history?page=1&status=PROCESSED
activate Gateway #34495E
Gateway -> QueryService: Roteia consulta de leitura para o Query Side
activate QueryService #1F618D

QueryService -> ReadDB: Lê projeção desnormalizada / Cache Redis\n(Sem JOINs pesados e sem bloquear o Write Store)
activate ReadDB #2471A3
ReadDB --> QueryService: Retorna lista paginada otimizada (< 5ms)
deactivate ReadDB

QueryService -->> Gateway: HTTP 200 OK (Histórico e URLs da CDN)
deactivate QueryService
Gateway -->> Client: HTTP 200 OK (Renderiza galeria e histórico atualizado)
deactivate Gateway

@enduml
